/T (Skilytics collects basic account information \(name and email\), uploaded resumes \(education, work experience, and skills\), and answers from the career interest quiz. Resume text and quiz answers are sent to AI services \(Google Gemini API and RunPod\) strictly to extract skills, evaluate career paths, and create personalized reskilling roadmaps. We never sell or share user data with advertisers.)
/E (Skilytics collects basic account information \(name and email\), uploaded resumes \(education, work experience, and skills\), and answers from the career interest quiz. Resume text and quiz answers are sent to AI services \(Google Gemini API and RunPod\) strictly to extract skills, evaluate career paths, and create personalized reskilling roadmaps. We never sell or share user data with advertisers.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 129 0 R
/T (All data is stored in a secure cloud database \(Neon Postgres\) using encrypted connections \(HTTPS/SSL\). System credentials and API keys remain protected on our backend server so sensitive data is never exposed to the public, and our AI service providers do not use submitted data to train their public models. )
/E (All data is stored in a secure cloud database \(Neon Postgres\) using encrypted connections \(HTTPS/SSL\). System credentials and API keys remain protected on our backend server so sensitive data is never exposed to the public, and our AI service providers do not use submitted data to train their public models. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1]
>>
