/Title (Skilytics collects basic account information \(name and email\), uploaded resumes \(education, work experience, and skills\), and answers from the career interest quiz. Resume text and quiz answers are sent to AI services \(Google Gemini API and RunPod\) strictly to extract skills, evaluate career paths, and create personalized reskilling roadmaps. We never sell or share user data with advertisers.)
